# UI rules

Canonical: `AGENTS.md`. Detail: `.cursor/skills/design-conventions/SKILL.md`.

- **Zero money literals** in JSX. Figures arrive as props from the engine.
- **Presentational components only.** Math in `src/lib`, called from pages.
- **Tokens only** in `globals.css`. No hardcoded hex or arbitrary type sizes.
- **Semantic color:** amber = confirmed; haze = estimated/stale; rust = cliff/shortfall only.
- **`.money`** tabular figures. One cliff-draw animation; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Mobile-first 390px phone shell. No em dashes in shipped copy. No TODO/placeholder.
